encounter_name = "Wounded Eagle"
description = "High on the rocky outcrop, you spot a magnificent Wedge-tailed Eagle with its wing caught in an old prospector's trap. The majestic bird looks at you with intelligent eyes, as if understanding you might be its salvation. What do you do?"
